      "blocks": {
        "d2397f4b-4ca1-46bf-b4f0-93799cf5b7fa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h1>Shop Bleusalt's Women's Bottoms</h1><h2>Luxurious Pants, Leggings, Shorts, Skirts & More</h2><p>Bleusalt offers a selection of stunning, Luxurious Women’s Bottoms—pants and skirts that cater to the modern woman's wardrobe. Crafted from the softest fibers on Earth, these garments provide unparalleled  elegance and versatility.<br/></p><p>Check out this <a href=\"/products/the-kaia-pant\" title=\"The Kaia Pant\">iconic pant designed for Kaia Gerber</a> or this <a href=\"/products/the-cindy-pant\" title=\"/products/the-cindy-pant\">luxuriously soft pant designed for Cindy Crawford</a>.</p><h2>Versatile Options Tailored to Your Lifestyle</h2><p>From the perfect fit to the softness of the fabric, every detail of our bottoms is carefully considered to ensure you feel both elegant throughout the day.<br/><br/>From classic pants and women’s trousers to sophisticated skirts and luxurious leggings, our Luxurious Women’s Bottoms collection offers versatile options for every occasion. Effortlessly transition from a day out to an evening gathering with our range of seasonless bottoms that can be dressed up or down.<br/><br/></p><h2>Flattering Silhouettes for All</h2><p>We believe that luxury fashion should be inclusive, celebrating the beauty of all body types. Our Luxurious women's bottoms are available in a range of sizes and flattering silhouettes, ensuring that every woman feels confident in Bleusalt.<br/></p><h2>Build Your Capsule Wardrobe</h2><p>A capsule wardrobe is a sustainable and minimalist approach to dressing, where quality takes precedence over quantity. Our Luxurious women's bottoms are the perfect foundation for building a versatile and timeless collection of essential pieces. With a capsule wardrobe, you can mix and match different styles to create countless outfits for various occasions.<br/></p><h2>Soft, Sustainable Materials</h2><p>We prioritize using high-quality, sustainable materials that are both gentle on the planet and your skin. Made from TENCEL™, our women's bottoms offer a luxurious feel while minimizing your environmental footprint.</p><h2>Shop Women’s Bottoms at Bleusalt</h2><p>Experience the beauty of quiet luxury with our women's bottoms collection. Elevate your wardrobe with our range of pants, leggings, joggers, shorts, and skirts.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
